      "body": "# LANE 4 — MERGED-PR-AUDIT — AUDIT-7 tracking\n\nUmbrella: https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/13871\n\nScope: every PR merged since 2026-10-23 across:\n- developing-today/code\n- developing-today-forks/opencode\n- developing-today-forks/openchamber\n- dezren39/fleet\n\nMethod: one by one, read PR + diff in full; compare to spawning issue (especially Closes/fixes); check later PRs completed earlier gaps before filing; file real gaps/bugs/next-steps properly prioritised; apply documented outcome labels; per-PR ledger in final report.\n\nOutcome labels (Lane 4 set, documented here and in final report):\n- `audit:complete` — PR fully implemented its spawning issue / stated intent, no gap found\n- `audit:partial` — PR partially implemented; gap filed (linked in ledger/comment)\n- `audit:gap-filed` — a gap / unfiled next step was filed as a new issue from this PR\n- `audit:bug-filed` — a bug found in the merged diff was filed as a new issue\n- `audit:completed-later` — earlier gap was completed by a later merged PR (linked)\n- `audit:no-issue` — PR had no spawning issue to compare against (verdict on stated intent only)\n\nProgress will be posted at every slice boundary (per repo / per batch).\n\nStatus: STARTED 2026-11-23 — enumerating merged PRs since 2026-10-23.\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-24T00:04:55Z\",\n    \"session_id\": null,\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"htch-runtime\",\n    \"worktree\": null,\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": null,\n    \"auth_subject\": \"archer\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metada